{"parse": {"title": "红墙-01", "pageid": 65745, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99\" title=\"阿尔古斯·红墙\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">红墙-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E5%A2%99-02\" title=\"红墙-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">红墙</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BF.A2.E9.81.A5.E6.88.96.E5.92.AB.E5.B0.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"迢遥或咫尺\">迢遥或咫尺</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 迢遥或咫尺</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-309720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>终于**的到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话语间，一双马靴在黄沙和荒草组成的道路上停下，房屋顶上的木桩十字伫立在视野尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在更远处的夜色下，杏子林直直铺向远方的山脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>哈。在德州你可能把草皮子都掀过来也找不到第二个“大都会”，但一定能碰见无数个“甜水镇”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>这也是其中一个了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在进入这座大地图上找不到的小镇之前，阿尔古斯把越野车停在了离它五百码的荒地上。她用蓬草把车顶盖起，剩下的路程都徒步进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去有太多经验告诉她，开车大摇大摆进入这类城镇，通常是不被欢迎的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>虽然从前不是没来过边境……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>但这地方离机场也太远了，趟过河去不就是墨西哥吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雇佣兵从鼓胀的裤兜里掏出一张折叠纸片，接着翻到另一面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝白相间的印刷，黑色像素组成字母与数字。半个代表地点的单词与仅仅标注出发的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张机票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>从沃斯堡出发……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>到这儿基本算是跨越整个德克萨斯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……她究竟来这些地方做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-309712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>等找到她，我一定得好好问问——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f7/HeadIconSmall-309713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>老样子，问话、奔走、一些可见的摩擦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闭上眼，她能清晰地听见“99瓶啤酒”的旋律从小镇边缘传来。此处俯仰可拾的不仅有风沙和碎叶，还有昼夜不歇的碰杯吵嚷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>声音的源头也是每块地界上消息流通最快的位置。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_meiguonanbu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_meiguonanbu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>找到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>并不是所有探寻都倚仗眼睛。雇佣兵继续迈开步子，向着最近的酒馆走去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>嘿。给我来杯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斟酌之中，她环视四周。酒馆里零星散布着边喝酒边猜拳的边境游民，残羹剩饭留在空桌上，看上去暂时没人收拾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在显然已经过了饭点，阿尔古斯只得走进去叫上一杯酒。毕竟她既不爱吃水煮土豆，也不偏好隔夜的炖鸡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>黑杰克。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>凝滞在擦杯子动作上的酒保从昏聩中睁开眼睛，显然是还没反应过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-627210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-627210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-627210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>哦，瞧瞧，来了个追星妞！要追牛仔的话你可来错地方了，咱们这儿没有北方小妞能上的车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>不过，你租的这身衣服看上去倒不错……皮套裤脱下来，借我穿穿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>毕竟你这样的北方妞用不上这玩意儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……哦，天。你在跟我说话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>抱歉，你看上去有点太迷你了，我一时之间没法儿判断那儿是不是有个东西在出声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">镇民Ⅰ：</div><div>你什么意思——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>而且，我不是北方人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>难道非要戴着南方邦联的徽章和头带才是自己人？拜托，如果耳朵和眼睛都派不上用场，你大可以摘下来捐给慈善机构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>奥斯汀那些穿西装的人都爱说什么来着？让我想想——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>噢！“公民友爱”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>看来住在边界线上的美国公民也该多展现一下自己的友爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑起来，手边轻轻掂了掂枪。这甚至并非刻意的动作，只是一个习惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎同时，酒保在喝高的男人掏出枪来之前，先行举手表示让步。他在空中打了个响指，试图引起注意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>嘿，嘿！伙计，没必要这样，那家伙也只是问问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>这儿平时都没什么人来，从本州其他地方过来的就更少了，这些人里我几乎没遇上过喝黑杰克的，不干这行的还可能听都没听过这东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>所以有酒还是没有？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>有，当然有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放下手时，酒保仍然觑着倚在阿尔古斯身侧的枪。虽然自己在柜面之下有足够的火力支持，但他不确定自己能够占得先机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>这样吧，这杯算我的，权当代他道歉了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一杯装在啤酒杯里的威士忌很快被放上台面。酒保耸耸肩，意思是只有这个，将就用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>你看怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不用，该付的钱我一个子儿都不会少你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>比起这个，你不如回答我几个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这话，男人微不可察地皱了皱眉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>你是条子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>……现在我相信你们这儿真的没什么人来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你没见过喝黑杰克的南方人，难道也没见过条子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>镇上只有治安官……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>那就少看点电视节目吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯瞅了一眼酒水，对此没什么讲究，只把酒杯拉到自己面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>呃，说真的，在这地方，你无聊的时候除了《法律与秩序》也没什么别的能看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>好，大律师。你有没有见过一个女孩，身高大概5英尺3英寸，栗色头发，绿色眼睛，说话有明显的德克萨斯口音？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一边问一边掏出零钱放到吧台上，机票也被顺手摸了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒保则马上把钱划拉到台面上本来就有的一堆纸币硬币里面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他用冰夹轻轻拨弄着钱币，同时漫不经心地答应问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我没见过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你确定？再仔细想想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯手上不自觉摩挲着机票，语气干涩。她拒绝这样的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>这儿的人流量不多，我确定我记得每一个来过这儿的人的样子，小姐。而且如果这样的女孩来过，我肯定印象深刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>不过，要是你说的这个人真的来过这里，而且失踪了，可不算是好信号……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你什么意思？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>你真的不是条子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不要用问题回答我的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有捏着机票的另一只手正空置，此时她以指节在桌面上敲击了两下表示提醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>……你这模样，倒也确实不像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我才应该觉得奇怪呢。既不是北方佬也不是条子，这地方更是早就没什么能猎的了，你带着把霰弹枪到处找人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>你难道不知道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒保的眼珠子飞快转动着，却没有继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>知道什么？你为什么说话总是说一半？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>如果你是想要钱，大可直说——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>噢，天，你是来“朝圣”的，是不？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我早该想到的。你的枪、你看人的眼神、你问话的方式……呃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>那地方没什么可去的，相信我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>你找的小姑娘也肯定不——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音戛然而止，雇佣兵的耐心也在拉扯中逐渐告罄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抽出别在后腰的刀与一叠现金，与手中的机票一起用力拍在桌上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>别像个毛没齐的小崽子一样吞吞吐吐的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>给你两个选择，说清楚，或者给我换个能说人话的家伙过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒保收声其实是因为注意到了她手上的机票。此时那把刀压平了机票，使得上面的信息一览无余。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>……你从沃斯堡过来这儿？专门？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>从我爷爷那时候起就没有北方人专程来这儿了，除非你是来进货的。所有人都知道去墨西哥该走休斯顿，再不济也是布朗斯维尔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>嘿！戴蒙德！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒保转过头去，朝着先前出言挑衅的那个镇上人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">戴蒙德：</div><div>啥？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我说过我不是北方人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-627212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-627212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-627212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>她从沃斯堡过来，找我打听那面墙，而且在找一个棕头发、绿眼睛的女孩——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我是说了女孩的事，但对天发誓，我从没提起过什么狗屎的墙——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>我不知道你在说什么！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-501401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">戴蒙德：</div><div>——见了鬼了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿尔古斯转过头去，眼看十秒前还喝得面红耳赤愤愤不平的男人，利落地脱离木椅站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他冲出去的速度显得无比清醒，以至于阿尔古斯甚至来不及做出任何阻拦的动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>你们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>——<b>她是个该死的雇佣兵！</b>快去通知治安官——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我会先稳住她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不，什么？——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div><b><span style=\"font-size:111%\">你们都给我等下！</span></b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>很遗憾，小姐，那面墙不欢迎任何的“朝圣”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"627201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"627201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-627201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-627201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">酒保：</div><div>我不能让你这样继续打探了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人最终还是从吧台下面拿出了那把史密斯·韦森，并且在阿尔古斯回头之前顺利上膛，对准了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这种距离的对峙中，即使并非德州人也很少有失手的可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔古斯：</div><div>不，伙计。我想——我想我们都需要冷静一下。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "红墙-01"}}